# Test artifacts
/test-results/

# Stray index directory from an older `.env` default; the code default is
# `./data/search_index`, which `/data/` already covers.
/search_index/

# Commit the lockfile: this crate builds a deployable binary, so the
# exact resolved graph is part of the release. Without it a rebuild
# resolves different versions and the SBOM describes a graph nobody
# can reconstruct.
!Cargo.lock

# ...but not a sub-crate's lockfile. The service's own Cargo.lock is
# the resolved graph for the binary; these are build artifacts of
# path dependencies built standalone.
migration/Cargo.lock
